    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A user-defined alert rule that fires when a named metric satisfies a threshold condition.</para>
<para>Rules are evaluated by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alert_rule_manager_1a8c8d5ed3e87c2098821fa7120cc33bf7" kindref="member">AlertRuleManager::evaluateRules()</ref> against a metric snapshot and translated into <ref refid="structthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alert" kindref="compound">Alert</ref> objects that are dispatched via <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alertmanager" kindref="compound">Alertmanager</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
